<section class="sec" id="trade"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro rv"><h2 class="h2">Put your money where your View is</h2><p class="lede">Act on any idea, your analyst’s or your own, with the price-to-Value gap and the whole debate in view: Views, counter-Views and Arguments.</p></div></div><div class="fcar rv"><div class="fcar-track"><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Trade right next to the idea</h3><p>Buy or sell in one click, without leaving the page.</p></div><div class="appwin browser dbt-host"><img src="/images/v2/tx_price_value.jpg" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: the trade ticket for Bitcoin next to a View and its counter-View" class="shot" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="dbt" aria-hidden="true"><div class="vw-card"><img src="/images/v2/tx_view_l_img.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="/images/v2/tx_view_l_head.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h4>Bitcoin's June 2026 low was the cycle bottom</h4><p>Bitcoin's price reached its lowest point of the current cycle in June 2026, and no subsequent decline falls below that level. The proposition holds that this trough marks the end of the downward phase, so the cycle's bottom is set and future prices are expected to stay above it.<span class="vw-more">…&nbsp; Show more</span></p><img class="vw-vote" src="/images/v2/tx_view_l_vote.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="vw-card"><img src="/images/v2/tx_view_r_img.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="/images/v2/tx_view_r_head.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h4>Bitcoin's June 2026 low was not the cycle bottom</h4><p>Bitcoin's price reached its low in June 2026, and that low is not the bottom of the current market cycle. The price is expected to trade below its June 2026 level at some later point before the cycle reaches its true floor.<span class="vw-more">…&nbsp; Show more</span></p><img class="vw-vote" src="/images/v2/tx_view_r_vote.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Every analyst’s money is real</h3><p>Portfolios are built from real trades on the blockchain. No screenshots, no paper trading.</p></div><div class="appwin browser"><img src="/images/v2/tx_track_record.jpg" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Every analyst’s money is real" class="shot" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>We never hold your funds</h3><p>You trade from your own wallet, created when you sign up.</p></div><div class="appwin browser"><img src="/images/v2/tx3_wallet.jpg" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: the Wallet, every asset you hold across your portfolios" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:1456/844;height:auto" width="1456" height="844" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article></div>
